    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i get that, but i'm hearing a lot of local business owners saying the compliance costs are actually going to be way higher than what people are estimating and might basically price them out of the market. do you think there's any real data to back up the idea that these regs actually help the economy in the long run, or is that just more of the theoretical stuff they talk about in DC?",
